            text="""Hi, my name is Minh, and I'm calling about an order I placed on your website last Monday. The order number is on my receipt if you need it. I received the jacket this morning, but unfortunately there are two problems with it. First, I ordered a medium, but the label says small, and it's really tight on me. Second, the color isn't what I expected. On the website it looked black, but the one I got is dark green. So I'd like to ask what we can do about this. The best option for me would be to exchange it for a black one in medium. If that size is sold out, I'd be happy to wait for new stock, as long as it's not more than a week or two. And if neither of those is possible, I'd like a full refund. Also, could you tell me if I need to pay for the return shipping? Please call me back when you get a chance. Thank you.""",
            demonstrates=["Giải thích vấn đề có cấu trúc (First… Second…)", "3 phương án theo thứ tự ưu tiên, có điều kiện (If…, as long as…)", "Hỏi thêm chi tiết thực tế (return shipping)", "Lịch sự, rõ ràng"],
